9","id":4603971188,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEmsGdA","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-02T15:28:04Z","updated_at":"2026-06-02T15:28:04Z","body":"> Text files aren't Resources, so technically quick open shouldn't be able to see them.\n\nThat's a fair assessment of the current technical background. But from a user side I'd argue that quick open should be able to open stuff that's supported in the text editor.\n\nThe editor needs to shift away from this \"everything relevant is a resource\" paradigm. (Since the GDScript longterm goal most certainly is, to drop the \"script is a resource\" thing).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4603971188/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4680349474","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119969#issuecomment-4680349474","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119969","id":4680349474,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFvh3Ig","user":{"login":"Z13457","id":122619143,"node_id":"U_kgDOB08FBw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122619143?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Z13457","html_url":"https://github.com/Z13457","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Z13457/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Z13457/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Z13457/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Z13457/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Z13457/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Z13457/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Z13457/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Z13457/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Z13457/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-11T12:08:02Z","updated_at":"2026-06-11T12:08:02Z","body":"I'm trying fixing the problem,but I found in godot v4.7-rc1(windows11), Quick Open does not find any text files even if they have already been opened.So I ran git bisect and found out the change is because of PR #114921.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4680349474/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4680939820","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119969#issuecomment-4680939820","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119969","id":4680939820,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFwF5LA","user":{"login":"green-yellw","id":110565845,"node_id":"U_kgDOBpcZ1Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/110565845?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/green-yellw","html_url":"https://github.com/green-yellw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/green-yellw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/green-yellw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/green-yellw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/green-yellw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/green-yellw/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/green-yellw/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/green-yellw/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/green-yellw/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/green-yellw/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-11T13:14:08Z","updated_at":"2026-06-11T13:14:08Z","body":"> I'm trying fixing the problem,but I found in godot v4.7-rc1(windows11), Quick Open does not find any text files even if they have already been opened.So I ran git bisect and found out the change is because of PR [#114921](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114921).\n\ni see ! thx for checking it out - and my bad for not testing experimental versions properly, could have found that quicker 🙇‍♀️\n\nforgive the noob question cos im new to this: should i update this issue to reflect the behaviour in 4.7 ? or make a separate issue, etc.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4680939820/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4681000615","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119969#issuecomment-4681000615","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119969","id":4681000615,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFwJmpw","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-11T13:20:53Z","updated_at":"2026-06-11T13:20:53Z","body":"The old behavior was not intended. Quick Open was only ever supposed to support Resources, so the fact that it could open text files might've been a result of some bug.\n\nNot saying that support for text files should not be added, it was just never properly implemented.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4681000615/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4681887594","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119969#issuecomment-4681887594","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119969","id":4681887594,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFw_vag","user":{"login":"Z13457","id":122619143,"node_id":"U_kgDOB08FBw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122619143?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Z13457","html_url":"https://github.com/Z13457","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Z13457/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Z13457/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Z13457/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Z13457/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Z13457/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Z13457/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Z13457/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Z13457/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Z13457/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-11T14:55:15Z","updated_at":"2026-06-11T14:55:15Z","body":"I debugged v4.6.3 and found Quick Open does not find any text files unless a text file has already been opened is because ClassDB::is_parent_class(TextFile, Resource) returns false ,while TextFile actually inherits from Resource.And after a text file is opened,ClassDB::is_parent_class(TextFile, Resource) returns true.I'll work on to figure out why this happens later.\n\nIn 4.7 rc1, QuickOpenDialog uses uid instead of filepath, but text files don't have uids, so adding uid to text file may be needed to enable Quick Open to open text.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4681887594/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4682287245","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119969#issuecomment-4682287245","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119969","id":4682287245,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFxYIjQ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-11T15:38:04Z","updated_at":"2026-06-11T15:39:00Z","body":"> And after a text file is opened, ClassDB::is_parent_class(TextFile, Resource) returns true.I'll work on to figure out why this happens later.\n\nLikely because TextFile is not explicitly registered, so it's added to ClassDB when first instance is created.\n\n> adding uid to text file may be needed to enable Quick Open to open text.\n\nThat would mean making text files into proper resources and adding `.uid` files to them, which comes with its own problems.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4682287245/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]